  "description": "Up to 60 Miles of Adventure\nPowered by a 48V 20Ah high-capacity battery, the Flow delivers up to 60 miles of riding range, giving you the freedom to explore farther with fewer charging stops.\n\n4000W Peak Power & 35 MPH Top Speed\nThe high-performance motor produces up to 4000W peak output, reaching speeds of 35 MPH and conquering hills up to 35° with confidence.\n\nBuilt for Every Terrain\nFeaturing 15×3-inch all-terrain pneumatic tires, dual hydraulic suspension, and a reinforced frame supporting up to 330 lbs, the Flow is ready for trails, gravel roads, and urban streets alike.\n\nUpgraded Comfort & Utility Package\nRide longer in comfort with the newly upgraded ergonomic seat, practical storage Organizer, and included rearview mirrors for everyday convenience.\n\nRide Smarter & Safer\nEquipped with NFC unlocking, dual braking systems, and backed by a 365-day quality assurance program, the Flow delivers security and peace of mind on every ride.",
